---
/**
 * A spectrum band, lifted from the waterfall display on the avionics
 * panels in the references. Pure texture: it breaks a wide panel the way
 * a rule cannot, and it is generated rather than drawn so the dither
 * stays even.
 */
---

<pre class="ascii waterfall" aria-hidden="true">              ░░░▒▒▓▓▓▓▓▒▒░░           ░ ░
            ░ ░░▒▒▓▓█▓█▓▓▒▒░░ ░       ░░░ 
             ░░▒▒▓▓█████▓▓▒▒░░         ░ ░
░           ░░▒▒▓▓███████▓▓▒▒░░       ░░░░
             ░░▒▒▒▓▓▓█▓▓▓▒▒▒░░         ░ ░</pre>

<style>
    /* 42 cells at Iosevka's 0.5em advance is 21em, so font-size =
       100/21 ≈ 4.7cqw fills whatever box it is dropped into. */
    .waterfall {
        width: 42ch;
        font-size: min(4.7cqw, 9px);
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--ramp-3);
        overflow: visible;
        user-select: none;
    }
</style>
